  "notes": [
    "cvc5 is the Bench binary /usr/local/bin/cvc5, whose --version line is 'cvc5 1.4.2 [git 282d5e0 on branch HEAD]' and whose SHA-256 is 6aecddf466552b83bb5883756c7955e0c9d5ddcc6d7f45b48c2f6e06a741b102; the reference runs it as `cvc5 --rlimit=5000000 <query>` (bench/statespace/lanes/cvc5.py).",
    "Each configuration ran once, in a fresh container, with a scratch copy of bench/statespace (without its tests and fixtures) and the fixture mounted read-only at /w; <sandbox>/work stands for that copy. The reference writes its queries to a temporary folder inside the container and removes it.",
    "Every verdict line is copied from the logs; values.configs.<config> is parsed from those lines by their labels, never typed.",
    "Z3's model values are not canonical: each witness is checked by replaying it in the reference interpreter, never by matching its values.",
    "This run is the course's reference checker, not a learner's: a learner's crate is graded by statespace check lab4.<k>, and its receipts record its own runs."
